<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To present our engineering journey with the clarity it deserves, we structured the entire build process into well-defined stages. Each stage highlights the simultaneous development across Hardware, Design, and Programming, allowing us to capture not only what we built, but how and why we built it. This staged approach helped us analyse challenges as they emerged, document the reasoning behind every decision, and record the innovative methods we used to overcome obstacles. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5 6]
>>
endobj
218 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (By reflecting at the end of each stage, we identified key learnings that directly informed improvements in later phases. This chronological structure transforms our build log into a coherent narrative, one that shows the evolution of our robot from initial concepts to competition-ready performance. It ensures that anyone reading the document can follow our process step-by-step, understand the depth of engineering involved, and appreciate the continuous refinement that shaped the final BaseBot.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
