/E (Our autonomous system integrates multiple high-impact innovations to ensure fast, reliable, and context-aware performance. Spur entry is controlled through a multi-sensor classifier combining QTR width detection, IR asymmetry, and left-side ultrasonic corridor analysis. Lap-based predictive logic guarantees that pickup and drop sequences activate only in their correct phases. Navigation speed is governed by dynamic error-driven scaling and tiered adaptive PID gains that stabilise turning and maximise straight-line speed. )
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [16 17]
>>
