/E (The Technologia Club led sessions on the software side of robotics, focusing on programming fundamentals, logic building, and microcontroller interfacing. Simultaneously, the Anveshika Club conducted hands-on demonstrations on robotic hardware, sensor wiring, and the physics behind robot motion.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [13]
>>
