1037 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Roblocs believes that every setback is an invitation to rise stronger. Our vision is to build a robots that endure pressure and adapt quickly. They had to be something we could add innovations to, after every failure. We believe challenges are not obstacles but battles that are meant only for those capable of fighting them. We wanted our failures to be analysed, corrected and never repeated. Through disciplined testing, documentation, and community engagement, we aim to prove that being Built for Battle is both our strength and our identity.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
