1039 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Roblocs stands for resilience shaped by engineering discipline. Our name draws from the playful spirit of Roblox, but our identity is forged through grit, precision, and relentless iteration. The blue in our palette reflects calm problem-solving under pressure, while off-white symbolizes clarity, simplicity, and minimal-waste engineering. Together, they represent our belief that powerful robots can emerge from limited resources if the mindset is strong enough.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
1040 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Our brand carries a dual truth: we build for battle, and we are built by battle. Every failure in our journey has directly led to a new mechanism, a corrected design, or a smarter algorithm. We celebrate transparency: showing our rebuilds, our tests, our breakdowns, our regained stability. Whether on Instagram, in our pit area, or during outreach events, Roblocs is recognized by its resilience, its honesty, and its readiness to face every challenge with innovation and unity.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [6]
>>
